      "value": "@{5e5961740ab4231b6f14d29c|full_name}: \nAccording to a previous comment yes. I wasn't in VRChat back then. But if you want it to be accurate, virtual keyboard input (such as the login) and desktop controls were also framerate dependent (cost me quite a lot of tries in Devouring back then due to a frame hitch at the very moment you had to turn exactly 90° often resulting in the input being extrapolated and making you spin wildly)\nNot sure if they still are but that seems to be a basic Unity issue to begin with.",
